<ServiceLayout title="Acupuncture" description="Frey Clinic of Chiropractic in Napoleon, OH offers acupuncture services to manage pain, reduce stress, and promote whole-body wellness." heroImage="/src/assets/images/hero-acupuncture.jpg" heroAlt="Professional acupuncture treatment at Frey Clinic">

<p>
  Acupuncture is a time-tested practice rooted in traditional medicine that works by stimulating specific points on the body to promote natural healing. At Frey Clinic of Chiropractic, we offer acupuncture as a complementary approach alongside chiropractic care.
</p>

<hr class="rule rule--accent" style="margin-block:var(--sp-6);" />

<h2>How acupuncture helps</h2>
<p>
  By inserting thin, sterile needles into precise points along the body's meridians, acupuncture stimulates the nervous system, promotes blood flow, and triggers the release of natural pain-relieving chemicals. Many patients find that acupuncture provides relief where other approaches have not.
</p>

<h2>Conditions treated with acupuncture</h2>
<p>Acupuncture can be effective for a wide range of conditions, including:</p>
<ul style="list-style:disc; padding-left:var(--sp-5); margin-bottom:var(--sp-5);">
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Chronic pain</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Headaches and migraines</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Stress and anxiety</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Joint pain</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Digestive issues</li>
  <li style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-2);">Sleep disturbances</li>
</ul>

<h2>What to expect</h2>
<p>
  Your acupuncture session begins with a brief consultation to discuss your concerns. The needles used are extremely thin — most patients feel minimal sensation during insertion. Sessions typically last 20–40 minutes. Many patients report feeling deeply relaxed during and after treatment.
</p>

</ServiceLayout>
